{"variant": "minutes", "year": 1986, "month": 2, "day": 16, "slug": "legal/settlement-summary-8890", "variant_int": 4, "html": "<section class=\"page-banner\"><div class=\"container\"><p class=\"text-uppercase mb-1\" style=\"color:var(--gold);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:.18em;font-size:.75rem\"><a href=\"/archive/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">Archive</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1986/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">1986</a> &rsaquo; <a href=\"/archive/1986/02/\" style=\"color:var(--gold)\">02</a> &rsaquo; 16</p><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.6);font-size:.72rem;margin-bottom:.4rem;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase\">Meeting Minutes &bull; MIN-1986-02-7731</p><h1 style=\"font-size:clamp(1.2rem,3vw,2rem);line-height:1.25\">Workforce Restructuring Committee — Settlement Summary</h1><p style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,.7);font-size:.9rem;margin-bottom:0\">1986-02-16 &bull; Offsite: The Steppenwolf Theatre, Chicago, IL</p></div></section><section style=\"padding:3rem 0;background:var(--surface)\"><div class=\"container\"><div class=\"row g-4\"><div class=\"col-lg-8\"><div style=\"background:white;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:4px solid var(--gold);padding:1.25rem 1.5rem;margin-bottom:2rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.12em;color:var(--gold);margin-bottom:.5rem\">Meeting Information</div><div style=\"display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3rem .8rem;font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem\"><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Committee</span><br><strong>Workforce Restructuring Committee</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Date</span><br><strong>1986-02-16</strong></div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Location</span><br>Offsite: The Steppenwolf Theatre, Chicago, IL</div><div><span style=\"font-size:.68rem;opacity:.55;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em\">Meeting Ref</span><br><code style=\"font-size:.75rem\">MIN-1986-02-7731</code></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;padding-top:.5rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><span style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:700;padding:.2rem .5rem;background:#dcfce7;color:#15803d;border:1px solid #86efac\">&#10003; QUORUM ESTABLISHED</span><span style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666\">8 of 10 members present</span></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Attendance</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th>Name</th><th>Title</th><th>Role</th><th style=\"text-align:center\">Present</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Nour Girma</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Sustainability Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Bankruptcy Counsel (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Fikirte Zafar</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Infrastructure</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Reinsurance Broker (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Ricky Stuart</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Senior Analyst, Policy Research</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Public Relations Advisor (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr style=\"opacity:.5\"><td style=\"font-weight:400\">Madison Hoang</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Program Management</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Auditor</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#ccc\">&mdash;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Adefunke Suzuki</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Growth Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Senior Manager</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Desi Aquino</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Data Governance</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">P&amp;C Actuary (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Georg Hashimoto</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Director of Enterprise Risk</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Life Actuary (External)</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Adefunke Wahyudi</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Chief Strategy Officer</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Committee Member</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr><tr><td style=\"font-weight:600\">Hyeri Bright</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem\">Vice President of Sustainability</td><td style=\"font-size:.75rem;color:#666\">Chief Legal Officer</td><td style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#15803d;font-weight:700\">&#10003;</span></td></tr></tbody></table></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Agenda</h5><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 1</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">HRIS Platform Assessment — Vendor Selection Update</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">Madison Hoang summarized findings from the HRIS Platform Assessment — Vendor Selection Update review, covering the period ending 1986-02-16. The committee noted 101 employees affected across 2 locations in the Health Savings Account Administration sector. A motion was introduced following discussion. See motion record below. Exhibit A contains the full supporting analysis.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Workforce Restructuring Committee approves the selection of Arken Benefits Partners as the vendor for the HRIS Platform Assessment — Vendor Selection Update and authorizes management to execute the final contract.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Desi Aquino &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Adefunke Wahyudi</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 8 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 0 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 2</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">CEO Succession Plan Review — Emergency &amp; Long-Term</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The CEO Succession Plan Review — Emergency &amp; Long-Term was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with international tax laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s international tax filings and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 3</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Job Architecture Redesign — Phase 1 Approval</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The Job Architecture Redesign — Phase 1 Approval was a review of the company&#x27;s real estate portfolio. The committee approved a plan to consolidate 101 office locations, resulting in an estimated annual savings of $101M.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To approve for digitization:</strong> RESOLVED, that the Workforce Restructuring Committee authorizes ACPWB to proceed with the engagement described in the materials presented, subject to the terms and conditions set forth in the engagement letter dated 1986-02-16.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Desi Aquino &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Nour Girma</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 5 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 2 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 4</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">Total Rewards Benchmarking — Peer Group Refresh</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The regular quarterly review of the Total Rewards Benchmarking — Peer Group Refresh was led by Desi Aquino. The data presented in Exhibit D showed performance to be on track with the 1986 operating plan. The committee acknowledged the positive progress and accepted the report as filed, with no further action required at this time.</p></div><div style=\"margin-bottom:1.5rem;padding-bottom:1.25rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border)\"><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#999;margin-bottom:.2rem\">Item 5</div><h6 style=\"font-size:.92rem;font-weight:700;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.6rem\">DEI Metrics Dashboard — Q1 Progress Report</h6><p style=\"font-size:.87rem;line-height:1.7;color:#333;margin-bottom:0\">The DEI Metrics Dashboard — Q1 Progress Report was a review of the company&#x27;s compliance with antitrust laws. The committee reviewed the company&#x27;s competitive practices and confirmed that they were in compliance.</p><div style=\"background:#f8f9fb;border:1px solid var(--border);border-left:3px solid var(--navy);padding:.8rem 1rem;margin-top:.65rem\"><div style=\"font-size:.62rem;font-weight:700;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:#888;margin-bottom:.4rem\">Motion</div><p style=\"margin-bottom:.4rem;font-size:.83rem;line-height:1.6;color:#333\"><strong>To conclude:</strong> RESOLVED, that the meeting be adjourned.</p><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555;margin-bottom:.3rem\"><strong>Moved:</strong> Nour Girma &nbsp;&bull;&nbsp; <strong>Seconded:</strong> Adefunke Wahyudi</div><div style=\"font-size:.8rem;color:#555\"><strong>Vote:</strong> 6 Yea &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Nay &nbsp;/&nbsp; 1 Abstain &nbsp;&mdash;&nbsp; <strong style=\"color:#15803d\">CARRIED</strong></div></div></div></div><div class=\"mb-4\"><h5 style=\"font-weight:800;color:var(--navy);text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.06em;font-size:.8rem;margin-bottom:1rem;padding-bottom:.5rem;border-bottom:2px solid var(--gold)\">Action Items</h5><table class=\"dash-table w-100\"><thead><tr><th style=\"width:2rem\">#</th><th>Description</th><th>Owner</th><th>Due</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">1</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a summary of the latest proxy advisor guidance on CEO Succession Plan Review — Emergency &amp; Long-Term</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Hine Reed</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-04-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">2</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s cybersecurity posture</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Irene Miller</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">3</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Analyze the impact of currency fluctuations on international operations</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Leroy Bolton</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">4</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Develop a project plan and timeline for the HRIS Platform Assessment — Vendor Selection Update initiative</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Pallavi Hong</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-03-28</td></tr><tr><td style=\"color:#999;font-weight:600\">5</td><td style=\"font-size:.83rem\">Prepare a presentation on the company&#x27;s talent retention strategy</td><td style=\"font-size:.78rem;font-weight:600;white-space:nowrap\">Opeyemi King</td><td style=\"font-size:.72rem;color:#666;white-space:nowrap\">1986-04-28</td></tr></tbody></table></div><div style=\"border:1px solid var(--border);padding:1rem 1.2rem;margin-bottom:1.5rem\"><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:#333;line-height:1.7;margin-bottom:.5rem\">There being no further business, a motion to adjourn was made and carried unanimously. Meeting adjourned at 2:45 PM CT.</p><p style=\"font-size:.83rem;margin-bottom:.75rem;color:#555\"><strong>Next meeting:</strong> 1986-03-15</p><div><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#888;margin-bottom:.25rem\">Respectfully submitted,</p><p style=\"font-size:.85rem;font-weight:600;color:var(--navy);margin-bottom:.1rem\">Hyeri Bright</p><p style=\"font-size:.78rem;color:#666;margin-bottom:.75rem\">Vice President of Sustainability, Chief Legal Officer</p><div style=\"display:flex;gap:2rem\"><div><div style=\"width:160px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Signature</div></div><div><div style=\"width:120px;border-bottom:1px solid #aaa;margin-bottom:.2rem;height:1.5rem\"></div><div style=\"font-size:.68rem;color:#888\">Approved: ___________</div></div></div></div></div><div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:1rem;border-top:1px solid var(--border)\"><a href=\"/archive/1986/02/15/amenity-benchmarking-analysis-4163/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--muted);text-decoration:none\">&larr; Previous</a><a href=\"/archive/1986/02/16/legal/settlement-summary-8890/esports-team-and-league-operations-review-9257/\" style=\"font-size:.85rem;color:var(--navy);font-weight:600;text-decoration:none\">Next &rarr;</a></div></div><div class=\"col-lg-4 d-none d-lg-block\"><div style=\"position:sticky;top:2rem\"><div class=\"acpwb-card mb-3\"><div style=\"font-size:.65rem;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.1em;color:v